WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:29.841
Zippy was stuck in a bush.

2
00:00:29.842 --> 00:00:34.134
"Help!" Zippy cried.

3
00:00:34.135 --> 00:00:46.579
"I'll get help," said Eddy.

4
00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:52.047
Eddy drove slowly back to school.

5
00:00:52.048 --> 00:00:56.049
Rain fell hard.

6
00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.307
Swish! Swish!

7
00:00:59.308 --> 00:01:09.298
Eddy's wipers went back and forth.

8
00:01:09.299 --> 00:01:17.035
Eddy saw Mr. Grill.

9
00:01:17.036 --> 00:01:20.132
"Eddy!" said Mr. Grill.

10
00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:23.259
"It's raining hard!

11
00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:25.389
Where's Zippy?"

12
00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:33.638
"Zippy is stuck," said Eddy.

13
00:01:33.639 --> 00:01:46.598
He led Mr. Grill to Zippy.

14
00:01:46.599 --> 00:01:53.253
"Please help!" said Zippy.

15
00:01:53.254 --> 00:02:02.129
"Hold on," said Mr. Grill.

16
00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:09.752
Mr. Grill dropped his hook.

17
00:02:09.753 --> 00:02:13.858
Then he pulled Zippy out.

18
00:02:13.859 --> 00:02:20.419
"Thanks!" said Zippy.

19
00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:28.608
They drove back to school.

20
00:02:28.609 --> 00:02:32.763
Zoom! Zippy sped up.

21
00:02:32.764 --> 00:02:39.526
"Slow down!" called Mr. Grill.

22
00:02:39.527 --> 00:02:53.703
"Stop right there, Zippy!"

23
00:02:53.704 --> 00:03:00.433
Eddy drove slowly past Zippy.

24
00:03:00.434 --> 00:03:03.585
He crossed the finish line first!

25
00:03:03.586 --> 00:03:11.864
Eddy won the race!
